OL,4,CI moved from Australia to the Welsh    
OL,5,Cvalleys because the houses are so cheap
OL,6,GA house-hunter has moved 10,000 miles  
OL,7,G(16,000km) from Australia to Wales'    
OL,8,Gmost affordable town because the       
OL,9,Gproperties are so cheap.               
OL,11,FJames Brown, 56, spotted the three-bed 
OL,12,Fhouse in Tylorstown, near Ferndale,    
OL,13,FRhondda Cynon Taf, online for #80,000  
OL,14,Fand put an offer in.                   
OL,16,FOriginally from the Midlands, Brown    
OL,17,Fsaid the equivalent property in his    
OL,18,Fhome region would have cost him        
OL,19,F#200,000.                              
